msgid ""
"Signing up with a display name, an e-mail address and a password; the "
"verification e-mail, and that signing in is refused until the address is "
"verified."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Signing up from an invitation link: the sign-up page says who invited you"
" to which board, and the board appears under \"Shared with me\" once the "
"address is verified. What an expired or cancelled invitation link shows."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Signing in with Google: no verification step, and when the same address "
"already has a local account, both ways of signing in lead to the same "
"account."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The user menu: changing the display name and initials (up to three "
"letters or digits; blank means \"derived from the display name\"), "
"changing the password, uploading or removing an avatar (JPEG, PNG, WebP "
"or GIF, at most 100 KB)."
msgstr ""

